<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMANY'S EILTS TO MISS WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMANY'S EILTS TO MISS WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>HERZOGENAURACH, Germany 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's defensive midfielder Dieter Eilts will miss Saturday's World Cup qualifier against Northern Ireland due to a knee injury.</p>
<p>Eilts travelled to Munich on Thursday to see a specialist, officials at the European champions' training camp said.</p>
<p>Bayern Munich midfielder Mehmet Scholl is also doubtful for the group nine match in Nuremberg because of an ankle injury.</p>
</text>
